# route_f_lordpromo_e16_fe7_great.keys: route_f_lordpromo_e16.keys with the FE7 ROM (FE8PC_FE7_ROM; v1.16.1), edited by hand:
#   Chapter 16's "yes" opens the class choice for each twin; both take the first, Great Lord (FE8's Master Lord).
#   tick 101,673: B instead of A on Eirika's choice: nothing happens (the promotion is not optional there);
#   the next A presses take Great Lord and "Change". Ephraim takes Great Lord with A.
#   ticks 105,856-105,879: the end-of-chapter "inventory full" menu (Sieglinde) opens 178 ticks later than in route_f_lordpromo_e16;
#   its five Downs and A are moved by 178 ticks (105,859-105,879), so Sieglinde goes to the convoy as there.
#   The units equal route_f_lordpromo_e16's automatic promotion with the FE7 ROM (class, level, stats, ranks).
#   Ticks 107,773-109,272 added: A every 6 ticks, as in route_f_lordpromo_e16_fe7.keys.
# Below: route_f_lordpromo_e16.keys' own header (its milestones are for the run without the FE7 ROM).
# FE8 Gate 0 key file (format: port/test/README.md, "Input file").
# Generated by port/test/oracle/route_bot.lua (ROUTE_STOP=saveto:17, ROUTE_DIFF=1, ROUTE_TICK=capture, ROUTE_WATCH=1, ROUTE_PREFIX=port/test/inputs/route_e16.keys:95729).
# Start: boot both sides with GATE0_SRAM_IN=e16_start.sav (the save's first 32 KiB: FNV-1a 95dd0bb9).
# Milestones and how to replay: port/test/inputs/README-routes.md.
# 107773 ticks. Stop reason: passed saveto:17
#
# Milestones seen while generating (route_check.lua re-derives them):
#   tick 708: new game started (chapterModeIndex set) (chapterIndex 16, turn 28, phase 00, gRNSeeds 3671 90ea 1496, gLCGRNValue 2d2089a1)
